Parameter 'max-image-size': can not convert: [true] to [int]

Usage: app_patch_match_mvs [params] input-directory 

	-d, --debug
		enable debug view.
	--gc-iterations (value:2)
		number of outer PatchMatch iterations performed with geometric consistency.
	-h, --help
		print help message.
	--max-image-size (value:true)
		maximum width or height of processed images.
	--method (value:1)
		PatchMatch method (0:GIPUMA_FAST 1:ACMH).
	--multi-scale (value:1)
		whether to use multi scale.
	--normal-level (value:0)
		display only every level th normal (0:disable draw).
	--num-threads (value:-1)
		number of threads for CPU processing (-1:auto detect).
	--output-directory (value:true)
		output directory.
	--pm-iterations (value:3)
		number of innier PatchMatch iterations.

	input-directory (value:/workspace/openscadeMCP/output/models/manual_cuda_test/cuda_mvs_input)
		input directory.
